{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["לא תעולל — 'פאה' is what it means, as written: ״עולל יעוללו כגפן״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "Rashbam reads the verb עולל here as referring to the act of gathering the small leftover clusters, connecting it to the word פאה, the corner-leftover, and supports this with a citation of Deuteronomy 32:32 where the same root appears in the context of vine-tending."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:00.858770285Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}